**Essential Duties**
--------------------

* Acts as liaison between consultant firms, contractors, regulators, and citizen groups;
* Works with consultant administration and inspection staff in overseeing construction practices, recommending/approving changes, and scheduling City Utility operations;
* Informs, recommends changes, and addresses citizen concerns;
* Represents City at progress meetings, schedules final inspections, and submits project close-out items including Notification of Acceptance;
* Represents Construction Section at neighborhood public awareness meetings prior to project start-up;
* Issues an award of contracts and accepts construction projects upon completion;
* Recommends major changes and approves minor changes to designs during construction;
* Manages and coordinates construction project activities with other City departments, businesses, utility companies, contractors, developers, consultants, citizens, and state and federal organizations;
